[00:13.90]1. Jehovah, our Father in heaven,
[00:16.34]Oh, this is a most sacred night!
[00:16.34]It was then, long ago, you determined to show
[00:39.76]Your love, justice, wisdom, and might.
[00:39.76]The Passover lamb gave protection,
[00:39.76]And your favored people were freed.
[00:39.76]Cent’ries later our Lord his own lifeblood outpoured
[00:40.22]To fulfill this divine prophecy.
[00:40.22]2. The bread and the wine are reminders,
[00:40.22]How great is the price that you paid.
[00:40.22]And the good that was done
[00:40.22]through the gift of your Son,
[00:41.50]In life and in death he obeyed.
[00:43.48]We gratefully keep this Memorial;
[00:58.16]This night is a time to recall
[01:00.10]How the death of your Son
[01:00.10]paid the ransom that won
[01:00.10]The redemption from death for us all.
[01:00.14]3. We’re gathered together before you.
[01:00.92]At your invitation we’ve come
[01:00.92]To give praise for your love that brought
[01:02.34]Christ from above
[01:05.66]And honor to you and your Son.
[01:28.02]The Lord’s Ev’ning Meal brings you glory
[01:52.46]And strengthens our heart and our mind.
[01:55.32]So we’ll walk ev’ry day as Christ showed us the way,
[02:02.12]And then life everlasting we’ll find.
